flowchart TD
 G[Versioned golden dataset] --> H[Freeze case IDs and dataset hash]
 B[Approved baseline bundle] --> R[Paired evaluation runner]
 C[Candidate bundle] --> R
 H --> R
 R --> D[Deterministic checks]
 R --> J[Optional calibrated judge]
 D --> M[Metric aggregator and slice analysis]
 J --> M
 M --> P{Policy gates}
 P -->|Quality, safety, latency or cost fail| F[Fail CI]
 P -->|All hard gates pass| S[Pass CI]
 F --> A[Immutable evaluation report]
 S --> A
 A --> X[Report hash + bundle digest + dataset hash]
 X --> Q[Promotion workflow verifies exact report]
